#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You must install the package `qiskit_qasm3_import ` to use this function. "
"Install using the following command.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para usar esta función, debes instalar el paquete `qiskit_qasm3_import`. "
"Instálalo con el siguiente comando.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
