#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Export to OpenQASM 3 {#export-to-openqasm-3}"
msgstr "Exportar a OpenQASM 3 {#export-to-openqasm-3}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can export Qiskit code to OpenQASM 3 with `dumps()`, which exports to a "
"string, or `dump()`, which exports to a file.\n"
msgstr ""
"Puedes exportar código de Qiskit a OpenQASM 3 con `dumps()`, que exporta a "
"una cadena de texto, o `dump()`, que exporta a un archivo.\n"

